<title>USA: Eagle Hardware to release results early.</title>
<headline>Eagle Hardware to release results early.</headline>
<dateline>RENTON, Wash. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle Hardware and Garden Inc said it would report 1996 fourth quarter and full year earnings on February 27, rather than March 6 as it had earlier stated.</p>
</text>
